  "clause_1_scope": "1.1 This standard covers the requirements relating to the performance and safety that is, strength, stability and durability of tables and desks to be used for in a seated and/or standing positions, used by adults. 12 This standard applies to completely manufactured/ fabricated tables and desks. It also applies to ready-to-assemble units; in that case the requirements of this standard shall apply to the assembled units.",
